  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ ( 5 × 4 – 6) + 4 = 1.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 4 and 6\n\nGiven: 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ ( 5 × 4 – 6) + 4 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ (__**5 × 6**__ – 4) + 6 = 1\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ (__30____** – 4**__) + 6 = 1\n\n⇒ __**126 ÷ 23**__ – __**138 ÷ 26**__ + 6 = 1\n\n⇒ __**5.48**__ – 5.30 __**+ 6**__ = 1\n\n⇒ __11.48 - 5.30__ = 1\n\n⇒ 6.18 ≠ 1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 138 and 126**\n\nGiven: 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ ( 5 × 4 – 6) + 4 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 138 ÷ 23 – 126 ÷ (__**5 × 4**__ – 6) + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ 138 ÷ 23 – 126 ÷ (__**20 – 6**__) + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**138 ÷ 23**__ – __**126 ÷ 14**__ + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __6__ – 9 __**+ 4**__ = 1\n\n⇒ __10 - 9__ = 1\n\n**⇒ 1 = 1**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 4 and 1\n\nGiven: 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ (5 × 4 – 6) + 4 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ (__**5 × 1**__ – 6) + 4 = 4\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ (__**5 – 6**__) + 4 = 4\n\n⇒ __**126 ÷ 23**__ – __**138 ÷ -1**__ + 4 = 4\n\n⇒ __5.48__ – (-138) __**+ 4**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**9**____.48** – (**____**-**____**138)**__ = 4\n\n⇒ -147.48 ≠ 4\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 23 and 138 \n\nGiven: 126 ÷ 23 – 138 ÷ ( 5 × 4 – 6) + 4 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 138 – 23 ÷ (__**5 × 4**__ – 6) + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ 126 ÷ 138 – 23 ÷ (__20____** – 6**__) + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**126 ÷ 138**__ – __**23**____** ÷ 14**__ + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**0.91**__ - 1.64 __**+ 4**__ = 1\n\n⇒ __4.91____ - 1.64__ = 1\n\n⇒ 3.27 ≠ 1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
